      {"id":"a02","type":"solutionTask","promptAr":"سجّل أو اكتب ردًا من 60–80 كلمة: لديك 20 متعلمًا و6 حواسيب وساعة واحدة. كيف ستغيّر الخطة؟ استعمل خمس كلمات من الدرس.","promptEn":"Record or write a 60–80 word response: you have 20 learners, 6 computers, and one hour. How will you adapt the plan? Use five lesson words.","minimumWords":60,"maximumWords":80,"minimumTargetVocabulary":5,"rubric":{"solution":3,"organization":2,"vocabulary":3,"accuracy":2}},
      {"id":"a03","type":"reflection","promptAr":"أي قرار في الحوار كان أهم؟ اذكر القرار وسببين.","promptEn":"Which decision in the dialogue was most important? Name it and give two reasons.","minimumReasons":2}
